              Deploying multi-grid inference routers and solar-aligned compute allocation. Managing ledger reconciliations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Slide 4 -->
          <div class="slide w-screen flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col justify-center px-12 md:px-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <span class="text-primary font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Phase 22</span>
